So, the two cases look somewhat similar: The "Illegal instruction" is repor=
ted around pthread_setcanceltype@plt; there are legal branch instructions t=
here as well as at the branch target locations; pthread_setcanceltype@plt i=
s called from timed wait functions (pthread_wait_np() and rt_task_sleep() r=
esp.).

We would be grateful for suggestions how to analyze and cure the problem.
